ATA[<p>What should you do if you have back pain? You can do what many people did in the village where I grew up. Find an old religious woman, lie face down on the floor, and let her step on your back three times while she recites her prayers. Or you can do what my father used to do, throw away your mattress, put something solid like a tile under your back, and sleep on it until the pain gives up before you do. Or you can go see a doctor and get medication…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.danburmawi.com/p/palestinianism-a-new-name-for-an?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web&embedding_publication_id=338673">https://www.danburmawi.com/p/palestinianism-a-new-name-for-an?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web&embedding_publication_id=338673</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/clash-of-civilization-links-10242026">Clash of Civilization Links, 10/21/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.danburmawi.com/p/palestinianism-a-new-name-for-an?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;embedding_publication_id=338673</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.danburmawi.com/p/palestinianism-a-new-name-for-an?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;embedding_publication_id=338673</guid><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:10:41 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why Is Islam More Aggressive in the West?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>About 16,000 jihadists from the Middle East and North Africa went to fight with jihadist groups in Syria and Iraq. That region has about 414 million Muslims, 94 percent of its population. Western Europe, where Muslims number about 26 million, under 5 percent of the population, produced more than 5,000. That is one jihadist for every 25,000 or so Muslims in the Middle East and North Africa, and one for every 5,000 in Western Europe, more than four times the rate…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.danburmawi.com/p/why-is-islam-more-aggressive-in-the?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web&embedding_publication_id=338673">https://www.danburmawi.com/p/why-is-islam-more-aggressive-in-the?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web&embedding_publication_id=338673</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/clash-of-civilization-links-10242026">Clash of Civilization Links, 10/21/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.danburmawi.com/p/why-is-islam-more-aggressive-in-the?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;embedding_publication_id=338673</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.danburmawi.com/p/why-is-islam-more-aggressive-in-the?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;embedding_publication_id=338673</guid><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:10:41 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[France Is Burning]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Look at them, this crowd of young people in France. They either set a firefighter on fire, or he caught on fire trying to extinguish a fire they set. And they just sit there filming, not trying to help him, nothing. Scenes like this are playing out all over France this week…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://roddreher.substack.com/p/france-is-burning?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web&embedding_publication_id=338673">https://roddreher.substack.com/p/france-is-burning?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web&embedding_publication_id=338673</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/clash-of-civilization-links-10242026">Clash of Civilization Links, 10/21/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://roddreher.substack.com/p/france-is-burning?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;embedding_publication_id=338673</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://roddreher.substack.com/p/france-is-burning?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_mediu